<section id="how-to-measure" class="py-24 px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto border-t border-hairline">
  <div class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-display-lg mb-4">How to Measure</h2>
    <p class="text-body-lg text-body max-w-2xl">Finding your exact size requires just two simple measurements. Use a soft measuring tape and measure while wearing a non-padded bra.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    <div class="bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-md p-8 relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-ink transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft font-mono mb-6">01</div>
      <h3 class="text-display-md mb-3">Underbust</h3>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body mb-6">Wrap the measuring tape snugly right under your bust. Ensure it is parallel to the ground all the way around your ribcage.</p>
      <div class="h-32 bg-canvas-soft rounded-sm border border-hairline flex items-center justify-center">
        <!-- Minimal SVG placeholder for visual guide -->
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="text-mute"><path d="M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8"/><path d="M4 12c2.21-1.33 4.63-2 7-2 2.37 0 4.79.67 7 2"/><path d="M4 12c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2 0-2 4-6 10-6s10 4 10 6c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-md p-8 relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-ink transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft font-mono mb-6">02</div>
      <h3 class="text-display-md mb-3">Overbust</h3>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body mb-6">Measure loosely around the fullest part of your bust. The tape should rest lightly without pressing into your skin.</p>
      <div class="h-32 bg-canvas-soft rounded-sm border border-hairline flex items-center justify-center">
        <!-- Minimal SVG placeholder for visual guide -->
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="text-mute"><path d="M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8"/><path d="M4 12c2.21-1.33 4.63-2 7-2 2.37 0 4.79.67 7 2"/><path d="M4 12c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2 0-2 4-6 10-6s10 4 10 6c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
